 - **Scrub:** **Pause When Scrubbed To Start** (default on): let go at the bar's start (value <= 0.005 or <= 0.1 s) it stays paused there (`EndScrub(false)`). Value changes are only acted on while scrubbing (the bar following the video never seeks).
