 ## Video player with controls
 MediaBoxWithControls ("Media Box With Controls") is a Media Box with a controls bar over it. Controls Class: a Widget Blueprint whose parent class is MediaBoxTransportBar (None: Project Settings > Media Box > Default Controls Class). Controls Behavior (tick to override the project's Default Controls Behavior): Preset YouTube (shown while the pointer moves, hidden 3 s after it stops or 0.1 s after it leaves while playing, always shown while paused, fades 0.1 s in / 0.25 s out, pointer hidden with the bar, click plays / pauses, subtitles lifted above the bar) or Custom (set Hide After Idle, Hide After Unhovered, the Show While... switches, fades). Controls Height (0.13 of the video height, like YouTube; Min / Max Height limits) scales the bar evenly to fit any video size and stretches it across; design the bar with a Horizontal Box or Overlay root, not a Canvas Panel. Controls Alignment / Padding place the bar.
 
-Transport bar parts (all optional, by name): PlayPauseButton, StopButton, ScrubBar, TimeText, VolumeSlider, MuteButton, SubtitlesButton, SubtitleText, SubtitleLanguageButton, SubtitleLanguageText, PlaybackSpeedButton, PlaybackSpeedText, FullscreenButton. Every control is also a function on the bar (Toggle Play Pause, Set / Get Playback Speed, Cycle Playback Speed, Toggle Fullscreen, Cycle Subtitle Language, Set / Get Volume, Toggle Mute...) for menus of your own (a right-click Info Card). TimeText: type {StartTime}, {EndTime}, {Remaining} into its text (or set Time Format); Not Started Time Format before it plays; Time Display (hours, milliseconds, delimiters). Pause When Scrubbed To Start (on). Remember Volume + Volume Save Name keep the volume between sessions.
+Transport bar parts (all optional, by name): PlayPauseButton, StopButton, ScrubBar, TimeText, VolumeSlider, MuteButton, SubtitlesButton, SubtitleText, SubtitleLanguageButton, SubtitleLanguageText, PlaybackSpeedButton, PlaybackSpeedText, FullscreenButton. Every control is also a function on the bar (Toggle Play Pause, Set / Get Video Playback Speed, Cycle Video Playback Speed, Toggle Fullscreen, Cycle Subtitle Language, Set / Get Volume, Toggle Mute...) for menus of your own (a right-click Info Card). TimeText: type {StartTime}, {EndTime}, {Remaining} into its text (or set Time Format); Not Started Time Format before it plays; Time Display (hours, milliseconds, delimiters). Pause When Scrubbed To Start (on). Remember Volume + Volume Save Name keep the volume between sessions.
 
 ## Audio in the world
 Audio Space World (On Diegetic Screen): a Media Box on a Diegetic Screen is heard from the screen - falloff (Inner Radius, Falloff Distance), muffled through walls (Occlusion, channel Visibility), level reverb; or give World Audio a Sound Attenuation asset. Each player hears it from their own camera (multiplayer and split screen work). Default 2D (UI).
